      "message": "fix(post): Carvera names a smoothing ask instead of dropping it\n\nThe Carvera post never read the Smoothing / SmoothingMode PARAMs (#616),\nso a document with per-operation smoothing on posted no word and no note.\nThe Carvera firmware's supported-codes tables list no blending or\nsmoothing word, so the post now writes the one-time\n\"SMOOTHING NOT WRITTEN - NO CARVERA FORM STATED\" comment, placed like\nthe Mazak note (end of the section preamble), and nothing else changes.\nSmoothing off stays byte-identical (the Carvera golden is unchanged).\n\nPinned by smoothing.rs carvera_names_the_ask_once_and_otherwise_posts_the_off_program.\n\nFixes #757\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
